iv></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-fvxzrP bFKOnZ pf-26_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO"><div class="sc-bBHxTw QejWU pf-27_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hOGkXu krzkQM pf-28_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-gWXbKe iZtXJr pf-29_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-31_">My phone's tiny storage space had me wanting to pull my hair out! Then a friend introduced me to this life-changing tech accessory...</span></h2><p class="sc-eGRUor iAsKXf pf-32_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-34_">If you own a smartphone (who doesn’t?), you’re probably familiar with the single most annoying notification that ever existed.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">“Your storage is almost full.”<br></span><br>It always stops you in your tracks at the worst moment – right when you’re in the middle of recording something important. Now you have to scroll through ALL your photos and videos and choose what you’re willing to trade to record THIS memory. It's enough to make you want to scream!<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">The phone manufacturers will tell you the best solution is to upgrade to a Cloud service.</span><br><br>After all, over 95 million people a year risk losing their graduation photos, baby pictures, and other family moments from accidental drops, rides in the washing machine, falls in the pool, etc..<br><br>But “the Cloud” isn’t for everybody. After all, you already paid them $1,000 for the phone. Plus, not everyone is comfortable with their photos floating around…..somewhere up there. Luckily, there’s another option – one that safely backs up, sorts and organizes your photos and videos in a safe place – without a monthly subscription fee.<br><br></span></p><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-gWXbKe iZtXJr pf-35_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-37_">It’s called ThePhotoStick Omni.</span></h2><p class="sc-eGRUor iAsKXf pf-38_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-40_">And it’s probably the best phone/tablet accessory to come out in the last couple years.<br></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_self" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-iUKqMP cXeOPA pf-41_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-f3380524--ThePhotoStick-Omni-Horizontal.png?v=1626275742" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-f3380524--ThePhotoStick-Omni-Horizontal.png?v=1626275742 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-f3380524--ThePhotoStick-Omni-Horizontal_500x.png?v=1626275742 320w" width="573" height="311" class="sc-caiLqq hgIkQQ"/></a><p class="sc-eGRUor iAsKXf pf-42_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-44_">This little adapter makes it so that their popular USB stick can fit into any of your devices and safely back up ALL of your photos and videos - instantly!<br><br>With <span style="font-weight: bold;"><a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank">ThePhotoStick Omni</a></span>, you can save tens of thousands of photos and/or videos and never have to worry about running out of storage space, or losing any of your memories!&nbsp;<br><br></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-fvxzrP bFKOnZ pf-45_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO"><div class="sc-bBHxTw QejWU pf-46_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hOGkXu krzkQM pf-47_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-gWXbKe iZtXJr pf-48_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-50_">It’s super simple to use – just three easy steps!</span></h2><p class="sc-eGRUor iAsKXf pf-51_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-53_"><span style="font-weight: bold;"><br>Step One:</span> Download ThePhotoStick App for FREE in the Google Play Store and Apple Store.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Step Two: </span>Plug one end of the adapter into the USB stick and plug the other end into your device. ThePhotoStick&nbsp;App will begin finding and sorting through all of the photos and videos stored onto your device.&nbsp;<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Step Three: </span>Remove the adapter from the USB stick and plug into your computer's USB port. <br><br>That's it! You're files will be safely transferred to your computer, freeing up precious memory space on your phone or tablet.<br></span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-bBHxTw QejWU pf-54_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hOGkXu krzkQM pf-55_"><div data-pf-type="HTML.Video" class="sc-cidDSM lkVECx pf-56_"><video width="100%" height="auto" type="video/mp4?v=1626132422" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/Attach-adapter-to-USB-stick--1-.mp4?v=1626132422" loop="" muted="" playsinline="" autoplay="" controlsList="nodownload" disablepictureinpicture=""></video></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-bBHxTw QejWU pf-57_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hOGkXu krzkQM pf-58_"><p class="sc-eGRUor iAsKXf pf-59_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-61_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Here are a few other things to love about <a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank">ThePhotoStick Omni</a>: <br></span><br>• It organizes your pictures and videos for you<br>• Works with almost any device or computer<br>• Comes in 32 GB, 64GB, 128GB and 256GB<br>• Secure – No one else can 